    @('security/Data-Loss-Prevention.md','SEC-DLP','classification-aware controls that prevent unauthorized disclosure','classified payload, actor purpose, destination, consent, and transfer context','allow, redact, quarantine, deny, or escalated-review decision with audit evidence','every egress path from protected storage, clients, AI context, logs, and federation','protected data leaves its permitted purpose, residency, audience, or retention boundary'),
    @('security/Fediverse-Security.md','SEC-FED','security controls for untrusted federated actors and instances','signed activities, remote instance posture, media, reports, and moderation signals','verified activity, rate decision, quarantine, block, or federation suspension record','the local ActivityPub server and every remote server, actor, object, and media origin','forged, replayed, abusive, or policy-incompatible activity affects a local user'),
