    @('security/Security-Architecture.md','SEC-ARCH','system-wide trust boundaries and composition of preventive, detective, and recovery controls','architecture inventory, data classifications, identities, dependencies, and threat models','control allocation, trust-boundary map, residual risks, and verification plan','local institutional authority composes with common services and untrusted federation','component controls pass individually while an end-to-end path bypasses them'),
    @('security/Supply-Chain-Security.md','SEC-SUP','integrity from source change through dependency resolution, build, release, and deployment','reviewed source, locked dependencies, hermetic build inputs, builder identity, and policy','signed artifact, SBOM, provenance, scan results, promotion decision, and revocation route','contributors and upstreams hand artifacts to builders, registries, and deployment controllers','a compromised dependency, maintainer, runner, or registry produces a trusted release'),
