    @('security/VM-Security.md','SEC-VM','virtual-machine image integrity, hypervisor isolation, lifecycle, and tenant controls','signed image, boot policy, tenant identity, network intent, and resource assignment','attested instance, isolated runtime, lifecycle evidence, and secure disposal record','guest, hypervisor, host management, storage, and campus network trust zones','a stale image, guest escape, snapshot leak, or management-plane compromise crosses tenants'),
