    @('security/Zero-Trust-Architecture.md','SEC-ZTA','continuous, context-aware authorization without implicit network trust','strong identity, device and workload posture, requested resource, action, and context','least-privilege decision, session constraints, telemetry, and re-evaluation trigger','each access request crosses an explicit policy-enforcement point regardless of location','network presence, prior authentication, or federation membership becomes permanent trust'),
    @('identity/ABAC-and-Policy.md','ID-ABAC','attribute-based decisions and lifecycle of authorization policy','verified subject, resource, action, environment attributes, and policy version','allow or deny decision, obligations, reason code, and evaluation evidence','policy decision points remain separate from enforcement points and source systems','missing, stale, conflicting, or attacker-controlled attributes grant access'),
